      "sha256": "df6b5c23460f88f1522e5c6a665e1efbb8322c3ae876c885530f3019aa284ee0",
      "reason": "The nitracline is a nonlinear diagnostic (depth of maximum vertical gradient) computed from monthly climatological means, so the offline result differs from an online diagnostic and this caveat must be stated.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "The nitracline from monthly means is a nonlinear diagnostic: average first, then locate the nitracline (the diagnostic of the mean state), the like-for-like choice against a WOA23 climatology, and state the order used.",
        "Average 1971-2000 with `temporal_aggregate` (`freq='mean'`), which weights by month length in the model calendar; `compute_basic_stat(op='mean', dim='time')` gives every month equal weight and is not a time average."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "basin-and-region-definitions",
